  "youtube": {
    "title": "Procrastination Is Stealing Your Dreams.",
    "description": "\"Just one quick break.\" Thirty days later, the file was still blank.\n\nA short animated story about procrastination - and the truth most people miss: it usually isn't laziness. It's fear of not being good enough.\n\nIf you're stuck right now: lock the phone away, start ugly, and do one small piece. The voice that says 'tomorrow' gets quieter every time you ignore it.\n\nStart before you feel ready.\n\n#procrastination #selfimprovement #discipline #motivation #animation #productivity",
